# Build context for images built from the repo root (knowledge_service/Dockerfile and the pipeline images):
# an ALLOWLIST - nothing is sent to Docker (and so nothing can end up inside an image) unless it is listed here.
# In particular .env, .venv, .git, model weights and the collected data never enter an image.
*
!knowledge_service/
!backend/knowledge/
!backend/usermemory/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
